            "title": "本地｜偏東氣流夾雜陣雨 天文台料周中市區低見16度",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"本地｜偏東氣流夾雜陣雨 天文台料周中市區低見16度\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">本地｜偏東氣流夾雜陣雨 天文台料周中市區低見16度</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">香港天文台表示，廣東沿岸正受偏東氣流影響，本港今日多雲兼有一兩陣雨，日間氣溫約23度，離岸及高地風勢間中強勁。天文台預料，明早華南沿岸會受東北季候風影響，天氣轉涼及有雨，周三及周四早晚清涼，市區最低約16度，新界再低兩三度。本周後期季候風稍為緩和，沿岸天色好轉，氣溫回升，但日夜溫差頗大。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0-%E5%81%8F%E6%9D%B1%E6%B0%A3%E6%B5%81%E5%A4%BE%E9%9B%9C%E9%99%A3%E9%9B%A8-%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%99%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%82%E5%8D%80%E4%BD%8E%E8%A6%8B16%E5%BA%A6-000052887.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 08:10:01",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
