            "title": "國際｜韓財金部門召開緊急會議 擬隨時啟動股市穩定基金",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜韓財金部門召開緊急會議 擬隨時啟動股市穩定基金\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜韓財金部門召開緊急會議 擬隨時啟動股市穩定基金</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">韓國財政經濟部周日召開緊急會議後表明，一旦市況進一步轉差，當地隨時可以動用市場穩定基金，並已即時籌備所需安排。當局同時決定把上市公司股份的每日額度限制暫時放寬三個月，以減低市場波動，並會密切注視槓桿投資及追繳保證金情況，嚴厲打擊非法賣空。另一邊廂，台灣已進一步收緊股票賣空規則，國安基金進場護盤。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E9%9F%93%E8%B2%A1%E9%87%91%E9%83%A8%E9%96%80%E5%8F%AC%E9%96%8B%E7%B7%8A%E6%80%A5%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0-%E6%93%AC%E9%9A%A8%E6%99%82%E5%95%9F%E5%8B%95%E8%82%A1%E5%B8%82%E7%A9%A9%E5%AE%9A%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91-233055574.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 07:36:12",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美股｜美股本周三日半市 聚焦PCE通脹數據與黑色星期五銷情",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜美股本周三日半市 聚焦PCE通脹數據與黑色星期五銷情\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜美股本周三日半市 聚焦PCE通脹數據與黑色星期五銷情</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美股三大指數上周跌逾8%至10%，本周因感恩節假期只有三個半交易日，周四全日休市，周五半日市。周五「黑色星期五」揭開傳統購物旺季，市場注視零售商客流、網購銷情及折扣力度。美國周三公布10月個人消費開支（PCE）物價指數，市場預期按年升幅擴大至3.8%，按月升幅收窄至0.3%。核心指數按年升幅料略增至3.2%，按月維持0.3%。同日公布第三季國內生產總值（GDP）按季年率修訂數據，估計增速維持3.4%。聯儲局本周發表褐皮書，百思買、戴爾科技及惠普等將公布業績。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1-%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E6%9C%AC%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%89%E6%97%A5%E5%8D%8A%E5%B8%82-%E8%81%9A%E7%84%A6pce%E9%80%9A%E8%84%B9%E6%95%B8%E6%93%9A%E8%88%87%E9%BB%91%E8%89%B2%E6%98%9F%E6%9C%9F%E4%BA%94%E9%8A%B7%E6%83%85-223053964.html",
