        {
            "title": "國際｜氣候大會閉幕未達共識　化石燃料爭議未解",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜氣候大會閉幕未達共識　化石燃料爭議未解\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜氣候大會閉幕未達共識　化石燃料爭議未解</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在土耳其安塔利亞舉行的聯合國氣候變化框架公約第31次締約方大會周日閉幕，各國未能就政治決定達成共識。主要協議遭多國否決，歐盟等拒絕支持一份未提及化石燃料的文本。化石燃料是今次談判的爭議核心，而能源價格飆升及中東局勢緊張令談判更形艱難。大會談判主席鮑恩表示遺憾，聯合國秘書長古特雷斯則稱深感失望。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E6%B0%A3%E5%80%99%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%83%E9%96%89%E5%B9%95%E6%9C%AA%E9%81%94%E5%85%B1%E8%AD%98-%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E7%87%83%E6%96%99%E7%88%AD%E8%AD%B0%E6%9C%AA%E8%A7%A3-220053816.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 06:05:11",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美股｜Capital Economics：標指半數市值涉AI 年底恐見6500點",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜Capital Economics：標指半數市值涉AI 年底恐見6500點\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5cbdf78fbdbffbba38b1328150eed69ab6486a7467c8519760ae326cc44e3474/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜Capital Economics：標指半數市值涉AI 年底恐見6500點</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Capital Economics指出，按市值計，標普500指數約一半與人工智能相關。該行把AI相關企業分為五類，並警告若AI需求減弱、監管收緊或融資環境轉差，風險可能擴散。該行預測標指由約7150點跌至年底6500點，並可能中途進一步下探，標指上次收報6910.39點。標指上周五已滑入調整區間，錄得2025年4月以來最差單周表現，納指亦較近期收市新高回落超過18%。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1-capital-economics-%E6%A8%99%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%8A%E6%95%B8%E5%B8%82%E5%80%BC%E6%B6%89ai-%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%95%E6%81%90%E8%A6%8B6500%E9%BB%9E-213053079.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 05:43:55",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "國際｜美駐巴林使館發警示 指伊朗與胡塞襲擊風險升溫",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜美駐巴林使館發警示 指伊朗與胡塞襲擊風險升溫\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜美駐巴林使館發警示 指伊朗與胡塞襲擊風險升溫</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國駐巴林大使館發出安全提醒，指也門胡塞武裝的襲擊威脅升溫，伊朗亦企圖襲擊區內的美國官員及設施，呼籲在巴林的美國公民保持警惕。提醒指出，科威特及巴林境內的美國設施早前已遭伊朗施襲，胡塞武裝則攻擊沙特阿拉伯的民用機場及關鍵基礎設施，釀成平民傷亡並令交通嚴重受阻，區內敵對行動或會急速升級。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E7%BE%8E%E9%A7%90%E5%B7%B4%E6%9E%97%E4%BD%BF%E9%A4%A8%E7%99%BC%E8%AD%A6%E7%A4%BA-%E6%8C%87%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E8%88%87%E8%83%A1%E5%A1%9E%E8%A5%B2%E6%93%8A%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E5%8D%87%E6%BA%AB-210052520.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 05:08:38",
