            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美股｜AI概念股急瀉 納指抹去年內升幅 英偉達四周挫42%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜AI概念股急瀉 納指抹去年內升幅 英偉達四周挫42%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜AI概念股急瀉 納指抹去年內升幅 英偉達四周挫42%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">人工智能相關股份本周急挫，納斯達克指數抹去年內升幅，較10月歷史高位低約18%。英偉達四周內瀉42%，超微跌約20%，美光過去一個月挫逾33%。Anthropic上市未能穩定市場情緒，有策略師認為不少優質企業已跌至吸引水平，但資金流向顯示投資者正轉持現金及美國國債。</p></div>",
